Review the memo, you can edit directly in the document, then click Approve: ${write_memo.memo_link}
Full report: ${report_ready.link}
Next step: email to the head. Recipient: ${get_ready.head_email} (${get_ready.head_email_source}) – you can edit or insert the email on the send email card (Next: the email to the Head, to the address above, taken from your message or your last memo email; type or change it on the Send Email card.)
